    "name": "Sri Manja Boutique Hotel",
    "detail": "Pro I came here with my wife during the holiday last week. Actually we booked for deluxe room,around RM128.On arrival,it seems all the deluxe rooms are fully occupied.So we had been offered for Superior Room for the same price In that superior room,no wifi can be detected.Then again we've been offered for Japanese Room for the same price!! The customer service here were excellent..i give full marks to them. All in all,i think this is one of the best affordable hotel in Kuantan,only 5 minutes to East Coast Mall (by car), got some new groceries nearby,Teluk cempedak is like 10 km away,not so far if travel by car Cons 1-small swimming pool 2-Small gym 3-In the toilet no bath tub But for me it didnt matter much, as the pros are much better in comparison to the cons Sri Manja Boutique Hotel will be my 1st choice if i'll travel to Kuantan. My 2 cents.. ",
